window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What do you get when you mix magic &amp; lawyers? More than you bargained for.</p> <p></p> <p>Lani's family has magic. Her friends have magic. Even the plants in her community are magical.</p> <p></p> <p>But Lani's powers never manifest, and she's tired of feeling like the odd one out. So she goes to law school and does her best to fit in with the non-magical world.</p> <p></p> <p>Too bad her first client is a geeky vampire. And her second client is an evil sorcerer. And her smoking hot one night stand doesn't remember her name.</p> <p></p> <p>If Lani survives her first week of work, she's gonna seriously consider a career change.</p>"; 
